canvas-gpt-sites is a TypeScript port of canvas-mcp for hosting on ChatGPT Sites.

Portions derived from canvas-mcp (https://github.com/vishalsachdev/canvas-mcp),
Copyright (c) 2025 Vishal Sachdev, MIT License. Tool names, descriptions, output
wording and the security design (anonymization tiers, untrusted-content fencing,
confirmation tokens, write allowlist) follow upstream v1.13.0
(commit 14fb51d0b1337707867494213e59509453bf5558).

